---
import LayoutDS from '@layouts/LayoutDS.astro';
---

<LayoutDS title="Introducción">
  <header class="mb-12 border-b border-gray-200 pb-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Design System: Arquitectura Multimodal</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
      Sistema de componentes inteligentes capaces de operar en tres modos distintos: 
      <span class="font-mono text-sm bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">Preview</span>, 
      <span class="font-mono text-sm bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">Batch</span> y 
      <span class="font-mono text-sm bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">Live</span>.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
    <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-100">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">01. Preview Mode</h3>
      <p class="text-blue-800 text-sm">
        Componentes puramente visuales. Sin lógica, sin listeners. Optimizados para renderizado rápido y vistas de solo lectura.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-purple-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-purple-100">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-900 mb-2">02. Batch Mode</h3>
      <p class="text-purple-800 text-sm">
        Integración con formularios tradicionales. Validación síncrona y envío de datos en lote al hacer submit.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-green-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-green-100">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">03. Live Mode</h3>
      <p class="text-green-800 text-sm">
        Componentes autónomos. Gestionan su propio estado y persistencia con debounce y feedback visual inmediato.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="mb-20 space-y-16">
    <!-- Atomic Design Explanation -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Metodología: Atomic Design</h2>
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          La estructura de carpetas <code>atoms</code> y <code>molecules</code> no es aleatoria; sigue el estándar de la metodología <strong>Atomic Design</strong>. Esto nos permite escalar el sistema de manera ordenada:
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-2xl">⚛️</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800">Atoms (Átomos)</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">
                Son los componentes más básicos e indivisibles. Por ejemplo: un <code>InputHTML</code>, un <code>Label</code>, un <code>Spinner</code> o un <code>Icon</code>. Por sí solos, son tontos y hacen una sola cosa.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-2xl">🧪</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800">Molecules (Moléculas)</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">
                Son grupos de átomos unidos que funcionan como una unidad. Por ejemplo: nuestro <code>DSInput</code> es una molécula que contiene múltiples átomos (Label + Input + Error + Icono de estado). Aquí es donde vive la "inteligencia" del Design System.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Architecture Diagram -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Diagrama de Flujo: Ciclo de Vida del Dato</h2>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        
        <!-- DESKTOP DIAGRAM (Horizontal) -->
        <div class="hidden md:block w-full">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 920 540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-auto font-sans">
            <defs>
              <marker id="arrow" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" refX="5" refY="3" orient="auto" fill="#64748b">
                <path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 L0,0" />
              </marker>
              <linearGradient id="gradCode" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f8fafc" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f1f5f9" />
              </linearGradient>
              <linearGradient id="gradHook" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#eff6ff" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#dbeafe" />
              </linearGradient>
               <linearGradient id="gradApi" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f0fdf4" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#dcfce7" />
              </linearGradient>
              <filter id="dropshadow" height="130%">
                <feGaussianBlur in="SourceAlpha" stdDeviation="2"/>
                <feOffset dx="0" dy="2" result="offsetblur"/>
                <feComponentTransfer>
                  <feFuncA type="linear" slope="0.1"/>
                </feComponentTransfer>
                <feMerge> 
                  <feMergeNode/>
                  <feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/> 
                </feMerge>
              </filter>
            </defs>

            <!-- LANE 1: CLIENT (User & Code) -->
            <g transform="translate(10,10)">
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="280" height="520" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="140" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" text-transform="uppercase" font-size="12">1. Cliente / Código</text>
              
              <!-- Code Block -->
              <g transform="translate(20, 60)" filter="url(#dropshadow)">
                <rect width="240" height="100" rx="6" fill="#1e293b"/>
                <circle cx="15" cy="15" r="4" fill="#ef4444"/>
                <circle cx="28" cy="15" r="4" fill="#f59e0b"/>
                <circle cx="41" cy="15" r="4" fill="#22c55e"/>
                <text x="20" y="45" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#fff">&lt;DSInput</text>
                <text x="40" y="62" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#60a5fa">mode="live"</text>
                <text x="40" y="79" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#c084fc">onSave={'{'}api.update{'}'}</text>
                <text x="20" y="96" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" fill="#fff">/&gt;</text>
              </g>

               <!-- User Interaction Icon -->
              <g transform="translate(100, 250)">
                 <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="30" fill="#f1f5f9" stroke="#cbd5e1"/>
                 <text x="40" y="45" text-anchor="middle" font-size="24">👆</text>
                 <text x="40" y="85" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#64748b">User types...</text>
              </g>
            </g>

            <!-- CONNECTOR 1: Props -->
            <line x1="290" y1="110" x2="330" y2="110" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>

            <!-- LANE 2: MOLECULE LOGIC -->
            <g transform="translate(320,10)">
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="280" height="520" rx="12" fill="url(#gradHook)" stroke="#bfdbfe" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="140" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af" text-transform="uppercase" font-size="12">2. Lógica (Hook)</text>
              
              <!-- Hook Logic Box -->
              <g transform="translate(20, 60)" filter="url(#dropshadow)">
                 <rect width="240" height="200" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#60a5fa"/>
                 <text x="120" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#2563eb" font-size="13">useFieldMode()</text>
                 <line x1="20" y1="35" x2="220" y2="35" stroke="#e2e8f0"/>
                 
                 <!-- Steps -->
                 <g transform="translate(25, 60)">
                    <rect width="190" height="24" rx="4" fill="#eff6ff"/>
                    <text x="10" y="16" font-size="11" fill="#1e40af">1. Detect Live Mode</text>
                 </g>
                 <g transform="translate(25, 90)">
                    <rect width="190" height="24" rx="4" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#fcd34d" stroke-dasharray="2,2"/>
                    <text x="10" y="16" font-size="11" fill="#b45309">2. Debounce (1000ms)</text>
                 </g>
                  <g transform="translate(25, 120)">
                    <rect width="190" height="24" rx="4" fill="#dcfce7"/>
                    <text x="10" y="16" font-size="11" fill="#166534">3. Save State: 'Saving'</text>
                 </g>
              </g>

              <!-- State Update -->
              <g transform="translate(20, 360)">
                  <rect width="240" height="120" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#a855f7" filter="url(#dropshadow)"/>
                  <text x="120" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#7e22ce" font-size="13">Reactive UI Updates</text>
                  <line x1="20" y1="35" x2="220" y2="35" stroke="#f3e8ff"/>
                  <text x="20" y="60" font-size="11" fill="#581c87">Input Value ➔ <tspan font-weight="bold">Updated</tspan></text>
                  <text x="20" y="85" font-size="11" fill="#581c87">Toast Status ➔ <tspan font-weight="bold" fill="#16a34a">Success</tspan></text>
              </g>
            </g>

            <!-- CONNECTOR 2: User Input -->
            <path d="M 220 310 C 260 310, 260 160, 340 160" fill="none" stroke="#64748b" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>

             <!-- CONNECTOR 3: API Call -->
            <line x1="600" y1="160" x2="640" y2="160" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
            <text x="605" y="150" font-size="10" fill="#3b82f6" font-weight="bold">await</text>

            <!-- LANE 3: API / BACKEND -->
            <g transform="translate(630,10)">
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="280" height="520" rx="12" fill="url(#gradApi)" stroke="#86efac" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="140" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d" text-transform="uppercase" font-size="12">3. Servidor / API</text>
              
              <!-- API Exec Box -->
              <g transform="translate(20, 110)" filter="url(#dropshadow)">
                 <rect width="240" height="100" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#22c55e"/>
                 <text x="120" y="25" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d" font-size="13">Ejecución onSave()</text>
                  <line x1="20" y1="35" x2="220" y2="35" stroke="#dcfce7"/>
                 <text x="20" y="55" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#166534">PUT /api/resource/1</text>
                 <text x="20" y="75" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#166534">Body: &#123; val: "..." &#125;</text>
                 
                  <!-- Cloud Icon Sim -->
                  <path d="M 180 60 Q 190 50 200 60 T 220 70" fill="none" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
              </g>
            </g>

            <!-- CONNECTOR 4: Response loop back -->
            <path d="M 750 210 C 750 300, 600 400, 560 400" fill="none" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
            <rect x="630" y="300" width="80" height="24" rx="4" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#86efac"/>
            <text x="670" y="316" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#166534" font-weight="bold">200 OK</text>

          </svg>
        </div>

        <!-- MOBILE DIAGRAM (Vertical) -->
        <div class="md:hidden w-full">
           <svg viewBox="0 0 320 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-auto font-sans">
             <defs>
               <marker id="arrowDown" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" refX="3" refY="6" orient="auto" fill="#64748b">
                 <path d="M0,0 L3,6 L6,0 L3,2" />
               </marker>
             </defs>

             <!-- 1. Code (Top) -->
             <g transform="translate(10, 10)">
                <rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="160" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#cbd5e1"/>
                <text x="150" y="20" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#334155" font-size="12">1. CLIENTE / CÓDIGO</text>
                <g transform="translate(30, 40)">
                   <rect width="240" height="80" rx="4" fill="#1e293b"/>
                   <text x="10" y="25" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#a78bfa">&lt;DSInput mode="live"</text>
                   <text x="10" y="40" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#60a5fa">onSave={'{'}api.put{'}'} /&gt;</text>
                </g>
                <text x="150" y="145" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">Usuario escribe...</text>
             </g>

             <!-- Arrow Down -->
             <line x1="160" y1="170" x2="160" y2="200" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowDown)"/>

             <!-- 2. Logic (Middle) -->
             <g transform="translate(10, 210)">
                <rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="280" rx="8" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#93c5fd"/>
                <text x="150" y="20" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af" font-size="12">2. LÓGICA (HOOK)</text>
                
                <g transform="translate(30, 40)">
                   <rect width="240" height="120" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#bfdbfe"/>
                   <text x="10" y="20" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#2563eb">useFieldMode()</text>
                   <text x="10" y="45" font-size="10" fill="#334155">1. Detect Change</text>
                   <text x="10" y="65" font-size="10" fill="#b45309">2. Debounce Wait...</text>
                   <text x="10" y="85" font-size="10" fill="#166534">3. Call onSave()</text>
                </g>

                <g transform="translate(30, 180)">
                   <rect width="240" height="80" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#a855f7"/>
                   <text x="10" y="20" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#7e22ce">Reactive UI</text>
                    <text x="10" y="45" font-size="10" fill="#581c87">Update Value</text>
                    <text x="10" y="65" font-size="10" fill="#15803d">Show Success Toast</text>
                </g>
             </g>

             <!-- Arrow Down -->
             <line x1="160" y1="490" x2="160" y2="520" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowDown)"/>

             <!-- 3. API (Bottom) -->
             <g transform="translate(10, 530)">
                <rect x="0" y="0" width="300" height="150" rx="8" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#86efac"/>
                 <text x="150" y="20" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d" font-size="12">3. SERVIDOR / API</text>
                 
                 <g transform="translate(30, 40)">
                    <rect width="240" height="80" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#22c55e"/>
                    <text x="10" y="20" font-weight="bold" font-size="10" fill="#15803d">Async Request</text>
                    <text x="10" y="45" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" fill="#166534">PUT /data</text>
                    <text x="10" y="65" font-weight="bold" font-size="10" fill="#15803d">Returns 200 OK</text>
                 </g>
             </g>
             
             <!-- Return Loop Line -->
             <path d="M 300 580 C 320 580, 320 350, 300 350" fill="none" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4,4"/>
             <text x="305" y="470" font-size="10" fill="#15803d" transform="rotate(90, 305, 470)">Respuesta</text>

           </svg>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 p-8 rounded-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-6">Core Architecture</h2>
    
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-400" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2 5a2 2 0 012-2h12a2 2 0 012 2v10a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V5zm3.293 1.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l3 3a1 1 0 010 1.414l-3 3a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L7.586 10 5.293 7.707a1 1 0 010-1.414zM11 12a1 1 0 100 2h3a1 1 0 100-2h-3z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          Universal Props Interface
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-3">
          Todos los componentes comparten una interfaz base que define su comportamiento mediante la prop <code>mode</code>.
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto text-xs"><code>{`type FieldMode = 'preview' | 'batch' | 'live';

interface UniversalProps {
  mode: FieldMode;
  label?: string;
  // ... props comunes
}

// Props específicas se unen con intersección
type Props = UniversalProps & (
  | PreviewProps 
  | BatchProps 
  | LiveProps
);`}</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-400" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          Headless Hook Pattern
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-3">
          La lógica de negocio se abstrae en <code>useFieldMode</code>, dejando a los componentes puramente visuales.
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto text-xs"><code>{`// El componente es "tonto", el hook es "listo"
const { inputProps, status, isLive } = useFieldMode(props);

return (
  <div className="relative">
    <input {...inputProps} />
    {isLive && <StatusIndicator status={status} />}
  </div>
);`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Patrones de Integración API</h2>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Live Integration -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
           <span class="bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded uppercase">Live Mode</span>
           Auto-Guardado (Granular)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
          En modo Live, el componente maneja su propio ciclo de vida de guardado (optimistic UI). Debes inyectar la función <code>onSave</code> que conecta con tu API. El componente maneja estados de carga, éxito y error automáticamente.
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg text-xs overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed"><code>{`// Componente Padre
const handleSave = async (newValue: string | number) => {
  // Tu llamada a API aqui
  await fetch('/api/endpoint/field', { 
    method: 'PUT', 
    body: JSON.stringify({ val: newValue }) 
  });
  // Si falla, lanzar error para que el input lo muestre
};

// Render
<DSInput 
  mode="live" 
  initialValue="Valor X"
  onSave={handleSave} 
  debounceTime={1000}
/>`}</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Batch Integration -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 flex items-center gap-2">
           <span class="bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded uppercase">Batch Mode</span>
           Formulario (Agrupado)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
          En modo Batch, el componente delega el registro del valor y validaciones a <code>react-hook-form</code>. La llamada a la API ocurre una sola vez en el <code>onSubmit</code> del formulario contenedor.
        </p>
        <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg text-xs overflow-x-auto leading-relaxed"><code>{`// Setup del Form
const { register, handleSubmit } = useForm();

const onSubmit = async (data) => {
  // data contiene { field_name: "valor" }
  await postToApi(data);
};

// Render
<form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>
  <DSInput 
    mode="batch" 
    name="field_name"
    register={register} 
    validation={{ required: true }}
  />
  <button>Guardar Todo</button>
</form>`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</LayoutDS>
